# Candidate-only notes for the V4 dashboard dev image.
#
# Compose currently builds the dashboard with context set to the repository
# root (see compose.dev.yaml), and Docker only reads a .dockerignore from
# the context root. This file is therefore NOT consumed by the current
# build; it records the intended exclusions if the context is ever narrowed
# to apps/dashboard. Deterministic context today comes from the narrow COPY
# list in apps/dashboard/Dockerfile.dev (package files, packages/shared,
# apps/dashboard only).

node_modules/
.next/
out/
dist/
*.log
.git
